<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd">
    <html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
    <head>
        <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"/>
    </head>
    <body>
        <p><I>Dear $USER_NAME,</I><br/></p>

        <p>Below is a summary of your request to import $IMPORT_NAME to <b>$productName</b> on $IMPORT_DATE <br></p>

        <p>
            Import Summary:<br>
            Number of records on import file: $IMPORT_FILE_SIZE<br>
            Imported: $IMPORT_FILE_NEW<br>
            Rejected: $IMPORT_FILE_IGNORED<br>
        </p>

        <p>
            Please find attached the rejected records. This file can be used to re-import
            the failed records. First correct any fields with errors and then convert the file
            to csv format using the save-as function in your editor.
        </p>

        <p>If you've any question please feel free to contact us at $support </p>

        <p><I>Sincerely yours,</I></p>

        <p><I>
            Customer Service Department, <br/>
            $productName support team <br/>
        </I>
        </p>
        $companyInfo
    </body>
</html>